  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "PROBLEM: Group banners look very compressed, becoming less legible.\n\nREPRO:\n\n1. Use the mobile Android client of VRChat\n\n2. Inspect any user's nameplates for their group banner, or look at any group banner in the Groups menu.\n\n3. You can see that banners are hard to view.\n\nOTHER COMMENTS:\n\nI am aware that this may be an intentional change to save memory on mobile. If this is an intentional change, I believe it might be in the best interest to hide group banners on nameplates unless the QM is open.\n\nGroup Gallery pictures currently do not appear compressed.\n\nSimilar past issue:\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/1470-group-pictures-appear-compressed",
